     "text": "A MARTÍNEZ, HOST: But instead of going to battleground states such as New Hampshire, Maine or Michigan, Trump is first heading today to the more reliably red state of Oklahoma. The White House removed CNN from the press pool for this trip just days after a federal judge stopped President Trump's efforts to ban CNN, MS NOW and Politico from the presidential office.",
